# Line ending policy.
#
# This project ships shell scripts to OpenWrt, where a CRLF shebang makes the
# init script fail with a ".common" error. Force LF everywhere so a clone on
# Windows behaves exactly like the source tree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be rewritten.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# Keep the generated README screenshots diffable.
*.svg text
